AVONE_CAN PACKAGE OVERVIEW
========================

Package:
  avone_can

Purpose:
  - CAN to ROS 2 interface tools for AV.ONE
  - DBC based CAN decode into ROS topics, plus simple simulated signal publishers


Files:

• can_2_ros.py
  - DBC CAN -> ROS 2 bridge
  - Reads CAN frames from SocketCAN (eg can0)
  - Decodes using a DBC (cantools)
  - Publishes one ROS topic per decoded signal

  Commands:

    CAN interface up (example 250k):
      sudo ip link set can0 down
      sudo ip link set can0 type can bitrate 250000
      sudo ip link set can0 up

    Run node (example):
      ros2 run avone_can can_2_ros \
        --ros-args \
        -p can_interface:=can0 \
        -p dbc_file:=/home/avone/NUTEAMSGIT/NUCAN/DBC\ Files/AV1.dbc


• sim_wheel_vel.py
  - Simulated wheel speed publisher
  - Used when testing without real CAN feedback

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_can sim_wheel_vel


• sim_steer_ang.py
  - Simulated steering angle publisher
  - Used when testing without real CAN feedback

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_can sim_steer_ang


