AVONE_LOCALISATION PACKAGE OVERVIEW
===============================

Package:
  avone_localisation

Purpose:
  - Localisation stack for AV.ONE (state estimation and frame alignment)
  - Runs robot_localization EKF pipelines (local odom filter, optional global/map aligned filter)
  - Supports GPS fusion via navsat_transform_node when GPS is available
  - Includes small helper nodes for IMU and GPS topic/frame plumbing (so Nav2 + control get stable /odom and /map inputs)
  - Provides a single-EKF option (avone_ekf) for simpler bringup and testing

Files:


• fix_to_odom.py
  - Converts a GPS Fix style input into an Odometry output
  - Useful for debugging and for providing odom-like streams into localisation pipelines

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_localisation fix_to_odom

• heading_to_imu.py
  - Converts a heading source into an IMU compatible message (yaw/orientation)
  - Used when heading comes from a non-IMU topic (eg dual GPS heading, computed yaw)

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_localisation heading_to_imu

• imu_start.py
  - Startup helper for IMU bringup and clean initialisation behaviour
  - Used to ensure a consistent startup state before EKF/navsat start consuming data

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_localisation imu_start


Config 

• avone_ekf.yaml
  - Single EKF configuration for simpler testing and bringup
  - Defines fusion inputs, frames, covariances, and output topics

• local_ekf.yaml
  - Local odometry EKF config (odom frame)
  - Typically fuses wheel odom + IMU for smooth short term motion

• global_ekf.yaml
  - Global/map EKF config (map frame)
  - Typically fuses local odom + GPS (via navsat_transform) for drift bounded global pose

• navsat_transform.yaml
  - navsat_transform_node config
  - Converts GPS Fix + IMU + filtered odom into a fused GPS odometry stream for the global EKF


Launch 

• avone_ekf.launch.py
  - Launches the single EKF pipeline using avone_ekf.yaml
  - Intended for simpler testing before moving to a dual-EKF (local + global) setup

  Command:
    ros2 launch avone_localisation avone_ekf.launch.py

• local_ekf.launch.py
  - Launches the local EKF pipeline

  Command:
    ros2 launch avone_localisation local_ekf.launch.py

• global_ekf.launch.py
  - Launches the global EKF pipeline (map aligned)

  Command:
    ros2 launch avone_localisation global_ekf.launch.py

• navsat_transform.launch.py
  - Launches navsat_transform_node for GPS fusion

  Command:
    ros2 launch avone_localisation navsat_transform.launch.py


