Files:


• yolo_base.py
  - Bare bones YOLO inference node
  - Minimal detection pipeline intended as a known-good baseline

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_yolo yolo_base

• yolo_node.py
  - More developed YOLO node for normal use
  - Publishes detections with correctly coloured bounding boxes for cone classes
  - Intended as the standard "daily driver" camera detection node

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_yolo yolo_node

• yolo_dev.py
  - Development and test program for cone detection
  - Includes position estimation (rough range/bearing or 3D estimate depending on input) and RViz markers
  - Used to validate model performance, tuning, and downstream interfaces

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_yolo yolo_dev

