  - Utility publisher for feeding images into the YOLO pipeline from a source (file/stream depending on implementation)
  - Used for testing without a live camera

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_yolo image_publisher

• video_publisher.py
  - Utility publisher for feeding video frames into the YOLO pipeline
  - Used for offline testing and recorded run playback

  Command:
    ros2 run avone_yolo video_publisher
